    {
      "snippet_id": "SNP-002",
      "snippet_text": "\"Edit. They charged me an unrequested 370 CAD subscription, but they refunded me, so all good, just stop charging unrequested subscriptions to people please\"",
      "context_before": null,
      "context_after": null,
      "location_pointer": {
        "pointer_type": "url",
        "pointer_value": "https://www.trustpilot.com/review/domestika.org?page=2"
      },
      "source_finding_id": "F-02",
      "finding_part": 1
    },
    {
      "snippet_id": "SNP-003",
      "snippet_text": "\"Domestika charged me $349, up from $169 last year. Their website says no refunds. I requested a refund anyway and notified PayPal. I canceled my subscription today.\"",
      "context_before": null,
      "context_after": null,
      "location_pointer": {
        "pointer_type": "url",
        "pointer_value": "https://www.trustpilot.com/review/domestika.org?page=2"
      },
      "source_finding_id": "F-04",
      "finding_part": 1
    },
    {
      "snippet_id": "SNP-004",
      "snippet_text": "\"I am writing this to warn others about Domestika's deceptive billing practices. What started as a small, one-off purchase has turned into a nightmare of unauthorized, high-value charges. In March 2025, I was charged $175 without any prior notification, renewal reminder, or receipt. Most recently, they hit my account for a staggering $361.70—a massive \\\"price hike\\\" that was also taken without consent or notice.\"",
      "context_before": null,
      "context_after": null,
      "location_pointer": {
